  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v0.2.0\n\n- Rebuilt the LINQ-to-SQL pipeline with typed SQL translation, direct result materialization, and compiled query caching.\n- Added MySQL support alongside SQLite, PostgreSQL, and SQL Server.\n- Expanded LINQ support for outer joins, set operations, grouping, subqueries, and query-only table-per-hierarchy inheritance.\n- Added `FromSql<T>()` for composing LINQ over parameterized SQL, `ToQueryString()` and `TagWith()` for inspecting and annotating queries, and `AsAsyncEnumerable()` for async streaming.\n- Added `ExecuteUpdate` and `ExecuteDelete`, along with async equivalents, for set-based changes. Added support for DataAnnotations mapping attributes.\n- **Breaking changes.** `KueryQueryProvider` and `KueryQueryable<T>` are now internal. Use `IQueryProvider` and `IQueryable<T>` in consuming code. `BaseTableQuery` was removed. Use `TableQuery<T>` or `IEnumerable<T>` as appropriate.",
